{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 4x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) 2x - 1", "option2": "খ) 2x<sup>2</sup> + 1", "option3": "গ) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup>(4x<sup>2</sup> - 1)<br />= x<sup>2</sup>{(2x)<sup>2</sup> - 1}<br />= x<sup>2</sup>(2x + 1)(2x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 4 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y - 2", "option2": "খ) x - y - 2", "option3": "গ) x + y + 2", "option4": "ঘ) x + y + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 4<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 4) - y<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + 2)<sup>2 </sup>- y<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + 2 + y)(x + 2 - y)<br />= (x + y + 2)(x - y + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a<sup>5</sup> + 4a এর উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup> + 2a - 2", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup> - 2a - 2", "option3": "গ) a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>a<sup>5</sup> + 4a<br />= a(a<sup>4</sup> + 4)<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (2)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - 2.a<sup>2</sup>.2}<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - (2a)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= a(a<sup>2</sup> + 2 + 2a)(a<sup>2</sup> + 2 - 2a)<br />= a(a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2)(a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 4X<sup>2</sup> - 9X - 9 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 3", "option2": "খ) x - 3", "option3": "গ) 4x + 5", "option4": "ঘ) 4x - 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>4X<sup>2</sup> - 9X - 9<br />= 4x<sup>2</sup> - 12x + 3x - 9<br />= 4x(x - 3) + 3(x - 3)<br />= (x - 3)(4x + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2xz + z<sup>2</sup> এর উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y + z", "option2": "খ) x - y - z", "option3": "গ) x - y + z", "option4": "ঘ) সবগুলোই উৎপাদক", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2xz + z<sup>2<br /></sup>= x<sup>2</sup> - 2xz + z<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup><br />= (x - z)<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + y - z)(x - y - z)</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>4</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup> - ab - b<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup> + ab - b<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) b<sup>2</sup> - ab - a<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> +b<sup>4</sup> <br />= (a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2.a<sup>2</sup>.b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ (b<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - (ab)<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3 ফাংশনে f(a) = 0 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) 3, 1", "option2": "খ) -3, -1", "option3": "গ) -3, 1", "option4": "ঘ) 3, -1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3<br />&there4; f(a) = a<sup>2</sup> - 4a + 3<br />f(a) = 0 হলে,<br />a<sup>2</sup> - 4a + 3 = 0<br />বা, a<sup>2</sup> - 3a - a + 3 = 0<br />বা, a(a - 3) - 1(a - 3) = 0<br />বা, (a - 3)(a - 1) = 0<br />&there4; a = 3, 1</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x<sup>6</sup> - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> - 1<br />= (x<sup>3</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>3</sup> + 1)(x<sup>3</sup> - 1)<br />= (x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)(x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 4x<sup>2</sup> + 5x - p যদি x + 2 দ্বারা বিভাজ্য হয় তবে p = ?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -5", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>f(x) = 4x<sup>2</sup> + 5x - p,<br />x + 2 দ্বারা বিভাজ্য হলে f(-2) = 0<br />&there4; 4(-2)<sup>2</sup> + 5(-2) - p = 0<br />বা, 16 - 10 - p = 0<br />বা, 6 - p = 0<br />&there4; p = 6</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x<sup>3</sup> - ax - 24 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 3 হলে, a = ?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> - ax - 24 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 3<br />&there4; f(3) = 0<br />বা, 3<sup>3</sup> - a.3 - 24 = 0<br />বা, 27 - 3a - 24 = 0<br />বা, 3a = 3<br />&there4; a = 1</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 11x - 6 এর উৎপাদকগুলো-", "option1": "ক) (x + 1),(x - 2),(x - 3)", "option2": "খ) (x - 1),(x - 2),(x - 3)", "option3": "গ) (x - 1),(x + 2),(x - 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (x - 1),(x - 2),(x + 3)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 11x - 6<br />= x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> - 5x<sup>2</sup> + 5x + 6x - 6<br />= x<sup>2</sup>(x - 1) - 5x(x - 1) + 6(x - 1)<br />= (x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - 5x + 6)<br />= (x - 1)(x - 2)(x - 3)</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 2a<sup>3</sup> + 16 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a - 2", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 4", "option3": "গ) a + 2", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> - 2a - 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2a<sup>3</sup> + 16<br />= 2(a<sup>3</sup> + 8)<br />= 2(a<sup>3</sup> + 2<sup>3</sup>)<br />= 2(a + 2)(a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 4)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) x<sup>2</sup> + ax - 10 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 5 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> + ax - 10 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 5 হলে,<br />f(5) = 0<br />বা, 25 + 5a - 10 = 0<br />বা, 5a + 15 = 0<br />বা, 5a = -15<br />&there4; a = -3</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) x<sup>4</sup> - 4x + 3 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 1", "option2": "খ) x - 1", "option3": "গ) x + 2", "option4": "ঘ) x - 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>f(x) = x<sup>4</sup> - 4x + 3<br />এখানে,<br />f(1) = 1 - 4 + 3 = 0<br />&there4; x - 1, f(x) এর একটি উৎপাদক।</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) a<sup>3</sup> - 6a<sup>2</sup> + 16 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a - 2", "option2": "খ) a + 2", "option3": "গ) a - 1", "option4": "ঘ) a + 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />f(a) = a<sup>3</sup> - 6a<sup>2</sup> + 16<br />&there4; f(2) = 2<sup>3</sup> - 6.2<sup>2</sup> + 16<br />= 8 - 24 + 16<br />= 24 - 24<br />= 0<br />&there4; a - 2,<br />f(a) এর উৎপাদক</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) 4x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 6 = 0 হলে x এর একটি মান-", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) -2", "option4": "ঘ) 3/4", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>f(x) = 4x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 6 = 0<br />এখানে,<br />f(-2) = 4.4 + 11(-2) + 6<br />= 16 - 22 + 6<br />= 0<br />&there4; x = -2</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x<sup>2</sup> + 8x + 15 = 0 হলে, x এর একটি মান-", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> + 8x + 15 = 0<br />&there4; f(-3) = (-3)<sup>2</sup> + 8(-3) + 15<br />= 9 - 24 + 15<br />= 24 - 24<br />= 0<br />&there4; x = -3</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) 2x<sup>3</sup> + 5x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 4 থেকে কত বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল x + 2 দ্বারা নিঃশেষে বিভাজ্য় হবে?", "option1": "ক) -20", "option2": "খ) 20", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>f(x) = 2x<sup>3</sup> + 5x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 4<br />&there4; f(-2) = 2(-2)<sup>3</sup> + 5(-2)<sup>2</sup> - 6(-2) + 4<br />= - 16 + 20 + 12 + 4<br />= 20<br />অর্থাৎ ভাগশেষ 20,<br />&there4; 20 বিয়োগ করতে হবে</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> + 7x + c, c এর কোন মানের জন্য f(5) = 0?", "option1": "ক) -60", "option2": "খ) 60", "option3": "গ) 30", "option4": "ঘ) -30", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু,<br />f(5) = 0<br />বা, 5<sup>2</sup> + 7.5 + c = 0<br />বা, 25 + 35 + c = 0<br />বা, c + 60 = 0<br />&there4; c = -60</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) f(x) = 7x<sup>2</sup> - x - 8 কে x + 1 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x + 1 দ্বারা f(x) কে ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ হবে<br />f(-1) = 7(-1)<sup>2</sup> - (-1) - 8<br />= 7 + 1 - 8<br />= 8 - 8<br />= 0</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1500000, "pk": 2507, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2507}